OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FBach's first solo cello suite,
OL,7,     FBeethoven's 'Ghost' piano trio and
OL,8,     FMendelssohn's first piano trio
OL,9,     Ffeature in the opening concert of
OL,10,     Fthe 2026 festival.
OL,11,G0630 Breakfast
OL,12,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,16,     FTom Service talks to the
OL,17,     Ftrailblazing American conductor
OL,18,     FMarin Alsop about her musical life
OL,19,     Fand why she's still up for the
OL,20,     Ffight for equality, plus a deep
OL,21,     Fdive into the Ocarina.
